{'symbol': 'EW', 'date': '2021-11-05 11:20:00', 'title': 'TAVR WITH SAPIEN 3 DEMONSTRATED AS ECONOMICALLY DOMINANT TREATMENT STRATEGY COMPARED TO SURGERY IN PARTNER 3 ANALYSIS', 'text': 'IRVINE, CALIF., NOV. 5, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0EDWARDS LIFESCIENCES (NYSE: EW) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT A COST-EFFECTIVENESS ANALYSIS COMPARING TRANSCATHETER AORTIC VALVE REPLACEMENT (TAVR) TO SURGERY DEMONSTRATED THAT TAVR WITH SAPIEN 3 IS AN ECONOMICALLY DOMINANT TREATMENT STRATEGY, OFFERING IMPROVED OUTCOMES AND REDUCED COST.'}